  factText: "Karbondioksit (CO\u2082) bitkilerin besin \xFCretmek (fotosentez) i\xE7in
    soludu\u011Fu gazd\u0131r. Ayr\u0131ca gazl\u0131 i\xE7ecekleri a\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
    \xE7\u0131kan o k\xF6p\xFCk ve \"t\u0131ss\" sesi CO\u2082 gaz\u0131d\u0131r."
